      "writtenOn": "2020-06-17T00:58:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like it should, IMHO. If you don\u0027t expect the wildcard to be used, I would create an \"illegal_key\" label, and map the wildcard to that label. Then add a neverallow rule prohibiting any operations on the illegal_key label.",
